A, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YONEDA, JUNKO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>EGUCHI TOORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA SHUJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIRAYAMA TOSHIKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU YASUMITSU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOCHIYAMA TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YONEDA JUNKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EGUCHI, TOORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA, SHUJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRAYAMA, TOSHIKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU, YASUMITSU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOCHIYAMA, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YONEDA, JUNKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A drug injector capable of accommodating nozzles of proper sizes and angles suitable for patients and permitting infection prevention and effective use of drugs by replacing nozzles, the injector comprising a barrel (1) provided at the tip end thereof with a nozzle mounting (11), a plunger (2) provided at the tip end thereof with a gasket (21) and a nozzle (3) removably attached to the nozzle mounting (11), the nozzle (3) comprising a mounting portion (31) to the barrel (1) and an ejection portion (32) extending from the mounting portion (31) after being bent at a preset angle.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention concerne un injecteur de médicaments pouvant recevoir des buses d'injection de tailles appropriées,montées selon des angles convenant pour différents patients. Ces buses remplaçables permettent de prévenir l'infection et favorisent une administration efficace des médicaments. L'injecteur comprend un cylindre (1) dont l'extrémité est munie d'un suport de montage de buse (11), un plongeur (2) terminé par un joint (21) et une buse d'injection (3) montée amovible sur le support (11). La buse d'injection (3) comprend une partie de montage raccordée au cylindre (1) et une partie injection (32) prolongeant la partie de montage (31) après cintrage selon un angle déterminé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>